[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1314","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0614","title":"Tnef 程序 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux系统中的Tnef程序存在任意文件写入漏洞，该程序在解压TNEF编码的压缩附件时未对解压输出路径进行合法性校验，允许远程攻击者通过在附件中指定绝对路径名，将解压后的文件写入到目标系统的任意位置。攻击者可利用此漏洞覆盖系统关键配置文件或可执行文件，从而提升权限或植入后门。该漏洞影响SUSE Linux等使用tnef工具的Linux发行版，无需身份认证即可触发，CVSS评分为10.0，危害等级极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0614"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06.793","remediation":"立即将 tnef 包升级至 0.124 及以上版本。在 SUSE Linux 上可通过运行 `zypper update tnef` 或使用 YaST 安全更新模块安装厂商补丁。升级前可临时禁用 tnef 服务以降低攻击面，确认更新完成后重新启用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vendor/2000-q3/0002.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1450","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b2be8fd4334c936c67f124199efee5b6ef5d0a06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0614.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0614","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0614/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6407093a9e2b3e61a3960c2e290e4a0a028bf4e0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0614.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4190a549751bffc11b00246a033a062f4109e196/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0614.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vxp6-2m83-3w8p/GHSA-vxp6-2m83-3w8p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1450/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0614.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-