us.com/bid/1460","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0605.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0605","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0605.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0605.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/96d4f89872236c04a1a34287b2e6b358501d08ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hv99-5fhv-j4mj/GHSA-hv99-5fhv-j4mj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1460/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0605.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c9b68d7e9fee580d97403fe7a317626fdb0fba2c/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--1e5f8cb9-2538-4917-be75-c95c66ca4b15.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0721.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0494","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0494.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0641","title":"Michael Lamont Savant WebServer 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Savant Web Server 2.1 及 3.0 版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送超长特制 GET 请求即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务器进程崩溃或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Savant Web Server 2.1 和 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0641"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.233","remediation":"立即停止使用 Savant Web Server（已停止维护，无官方补丁），迁移至受支持的产品如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 Microsoft IIS。如无法立即迁移，可在前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx、HAProxy）对 HTTP GET 请求 URI 长度做严格限制（建议不超过 4096 字节），并在网络边界防火墙限制 Savant 端口（默认 80/443）仅对可信 IP 开放，同时部署 IDS/IPS 规则检测超长 GET 请求攻击流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0114.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1453","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4901","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20066","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0641.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0641","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0641.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0641.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m69c-hmx8-c8ph/GHSA-m69c-hmx8-c8ph.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0641.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/fb27339bf790f38603dcf52a87a4652cadb30c7e/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2009/www_too_long_url.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0494.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0493","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0493.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0640","title":"Guild FTPD 0.9.7 目录遍历文件存在泄露漏洞","description":"Guild FTPD 0.9.7 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送包含 `..` 路径序列的特制请求，利用不同错误响应信息判断 FTP 根目录之外的文件是否存在，从而导致敏感文件信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Guild FTPD 0.9.7 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。目前官方尚未发布补丁，建议通过访问控制限制非授权用户访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0640"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.107","remediation":"立即升级 Guild FTPD 至 0.9.8 以上版本，该版本修复了路径遍历检查不严导致文件存在泄露的问题。如厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至 actively maintained 的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD），并在防火墙端限制对 21 端口的非必要访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0114.html","http://www.osvdb.org/573","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1452","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4922","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20065","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0640","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0640.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0640.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pfr8-644q-f99g/GHSA-pfr8-644q-f99g.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/G/guild_ftp.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0640.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0789","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0789.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0651","title":"Novell BorderManager ClientTrust 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Novell BorderManager 的 ClientTrust 程序存在认证请求来源验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过捕获并重放受害者主机 3024 端口的认证请求与响应数据包，冒充合法用户身份获取系统未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Novell BorderManager 多版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危，利用方式简单且远程可达。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0651"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.513","remediation":"立即安装 Novell 官方针对 BorderManager ClientTrust 认证验证漏洞发布的安全补丁（参考 Novell 安全公告及 SecurityFocus BID 1440）。由于 Novell BorderManager 已停止维护多年，建议规划迁移至受支持的替代方案（如 OES 或第三方网关产品）；在无法升级的环境下，在防火墙上限制对 TCP/UDP 3024 端口的访问，仅允许可信源 IP，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1440","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=06256915.00591E18.00%40uprrsmtp2.notes.up.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5186","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0651.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0651","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0651.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0651.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wf72-vr87-m228/GHSA-wf72-vr87-m228.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0651.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f88adb2a-2f0f-4134-8725-fe9a851d7e83.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f88adb2a-2f0f-4134-8725-fe9a851d7e83.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0789.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0717","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0717.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0603","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 存储过程权限绕过漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 存在存储过程权限绕过漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建临时存储过程引用受保护的存储过程，绕过权限检查执行其逻辑，导致权限提升或数据泄露。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0，攻击者需具备本地数据库访问权限并能创建临时存储过程，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响），微软已发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0603"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05.487","remediation":"建议立即升级 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 至 SQL Server 2000 SP4 或更高版本（如 SQL Server 2005/2008/2012/2014/2016/2017/2019/2022），或安装微软发布的 MS00-048 安全补丁（KB265669）。若暂无法升级，可采取临时缓解措施：1）撤销普通用户创建临时存储过程的权限（REVOKE CREATE PROCEDURE TO PUBLIC）；2）限制数据库用户仅拥有必要的最小权限，移除不必要的 db_owner/db_ddladmin 角色；3）启用 SQL Server 审核功能监控临时存储过程创建与执行行为；4）在网络层面限制数据库端口（默认 1433）仅允许受信任 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1444","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-048","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4921","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0603.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0603","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fbf5034ab66635f118016eef30012810a55b9a37/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0603.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0603.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/797a0a07abd34902460662a11cdad773c22543c8/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0603.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0603.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/mssql_version.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0603.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0717.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0459","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0459.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0574","title":"OpenBSD ftpd 格式字符串漏洞","description":"OpenBSD ftpd、NetBSD ftpd、ProFTPd 和 Opieftpd 等 FTP 服务器在调用 setproctitle（或 set_proc_title）函数时，未能正确过滤用户可控的格式字符串，导致远程攻击者可以通过发送包含格式字符串特符的输入，触发拒绝服务或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响上述多种 BSD 系及第三方 FTP 服务器软件，攻击者无需预认证，仅通过网络向目标 FTP 服务发送特制数据即可利用，攻击复杂度低，后果为服务中断或潜在的命令执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0574"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01.777","remediation":"建议立即升级受影响 FTP 服务到修复版本：OpenBSD 升级至 2.8 或更高版本（含 ftpd 格式化字符串修复补丁），NetBSD 升级至 1.5 或更高版本，ProFTPd 升级至 1.2.3 或更高版本，Opieftpd 升级至最新版本。如无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务（TCP 21 端口）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或暂时停用不必要的 FTP 服务作为临时缓解措施。建议同时检查系统日志中是否存在异常格式化字符串攻击痕迹（如 %n、%s 等异常格式化符号）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0031.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0061.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0121.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-13.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1425","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1438","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/396","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0574.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0574","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0574.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0574.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8prx-m86f-2h6h/GHSA-8prx-m86f-2h6h.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_setproctitle.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0574.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--806c661a-ead4-4e4c-aacd-e3dc401974eb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0459.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0458","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0458.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0573","title":"wu-ftpd FTP服务器 格式字符串漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 2.6.0 及更早版本的 lreply 函数在处理 SITE EXEC 命令时未正确过滤用户提供的格式字符串，导致远程攻击者可在无需身份认证的情况下，通过发送包含特制格式字符串的恶意 FTP 命令触发栈覆盖，进而在目标系统上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响包括 WU-FTPD 2.4.2/2.5.0/2.6.0 及 BeroFTPD 1.3.4(1) 在内的多版本 FTP 服务器软件，只要目标开放 FTP 服务且攻击者能够建立网络连接即可被利用，可造成完全的系统沦陷与数据泄露。攻击复杂度低且无需交互，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0573"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01.597","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即将 wu-ftpd 升级至 2.6.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 lreply 函数的格式字符串漏洞。临时缓解措施：在 ftpaccess 配置文件中注释掉 SITE EXEC 命令（将 SITE EXEC 所在行前加 #），或禁用匿名 FTP 访问。同时建议在防火墙层面限制 21 端口的外部访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0244.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0017.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96171893218000&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96179429114160&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96299933720862&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-020.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-13.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-039.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1387","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000623091822.3321.qmail%40fiver.freemessage.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4773","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20030","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0573.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0573.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0573","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0573/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1971.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0573.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0573.md","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0702","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0702.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0595","title":"FreeBSD libedit 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中 libedit 库在搜索 .editrc 配置文件时存在不安全搜索路径漏洞。libedit 会优先查找当前目录而非用户主目录中的 .editrc 文件，本地攻击者可在共享目录中植入恶意 .editrc 配置文件。当其他用户在该目录中调用依赖 libedit 的程序（如 sh、ftp）时，恶意配置代码将被执行，造成本地权限提升或任意代码执行。攻击需对目标目录拥有写入权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0595"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.467","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 至 2000-05-22 之后的版本，或从 ftp://ftp.FreeBSD.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/patches/SA-00:24/libedit.patch 下载补丁，进入 /usr/src/lib/libedit 执行 `patch -p < libedit.patch` 后重新编译系统。临时缓解措施：避免在可被其他用户写入的目录（如 /tmp）中交互式运行依赖 libedit 的二进制程序（如 /bin/sh、/usr/bin/ftp）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-07/0035.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1446","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1437","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0595.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0595","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0595.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0595.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cm4m-9c34-c8p6/GHSA-cm4m-9c34-c8p6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0595.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6a253d53-9493-454b-9e15-f7a89696feac.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0702.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0696","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0696.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0591","title":"Novell BorderManager URL过滤安全绕过漏洞","description":"Novell BorderManager 3.0 和 3.5 版本存在安全绕过漏洞，攻击者通过在请求的 URL 中对特定字符进行编码，可绕过系统的 URL 过滤机制。该漏洞无需身份认证即可被远程利用，攻击者发送经过编码的恶意 URL 请求即可绕过内容过滤规则，访问被禁止的资源或执行未授权操作。CVSS 评分为 5.8，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0591"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.947","remediation":"建议升级至 Novell 官方提供的修复补丁或最新 Support Pack；同时需在代理服务器配置中启用 URL 规范化检查，对请求路径先做完全 URL 解码再匹配黑白名单规则，防止编码绕过。由于 Novell BorderManager 已停止技术支持多年，强烈建议迁移至受支持的现代安全网关或代理产品（如 Squid、Palo Alto Networks 等）作为根本解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1432","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9109d68a178976362705ce50907751bdcde442d8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0591.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0591","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3176af43a10fe85712ec51e894c680f4a3fa6e09/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0591.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c4ba9b961b129b77c10e28189b9922bd2854ac1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0591.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f1681edc3f70c2637ccb21590e6662de194aa5b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hvq3-qm62-8ff5/GHSA-hvq3-qm62-8ff5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0591.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0696.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0673","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0673.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0576","title":"Oracle Web Listener URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 Oracle AIX 系统的 Web 监听服务漏洞。Oracle Web Listener for AIX 4.0.7.0.0 和 4.0.8.1.0 版本存在安全弱点，攻击者无需身份验证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的恶意 URL 包触发拒绝服务条件。该漏洞利用于 Web 监听器异常终止或重启，导致相关 Web 服务无法正常响应和处理请求。漏洞影响范围广泛，涵盖 4.0.7.0.0 和 4.0.8.1.0 两个版本的所有 AIX 平台。攻击过程相对简单，只需发送精心构造的无效 URL 即可触发漏洞。当前已知 CVSS 评分 5.0（MEDIUM 等级），为低复杂度网络攻击类型，不需要任何权限即可远程触发。对此漏洞的安全措施包括避免向系统中发送非标准 URL 请求，以及及时升级到 Oracle 为 AIX 系统发布的补丁支持版本。Oracle 已经在 2024 年 8 月的安全更新中发布了修复漏洞的补丁包，建议相关用户尽快更新系统版本。 (CVE-2000-0576)","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0576"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.060","remediation":"建议立即升级 Oracle Web Listener 至 4.0.8.2.0 或更高版本，或应用 Oracle 官方安全补丁 (Oracle Critical Patch Update 2000年10月版)。若暂时无法升级，可在网络层面配置防火墙规则拦截异常 URL 请求（如包含超长路径、异常字符的请求），或在 Web 服务器前端部署 WAF 规则拦截异常 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1427","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0576.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0576","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0576.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0576.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rx3c-x33m-733h/GHSA-rx3c-x33m-733h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0576.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7fc3a362fe2ed953eeef9b5e8338257b16438f86/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0673.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0671","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0671.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0575","title":"SSH Communications Security SSH 1.2.27 Kerberos 票据缓存嗅探漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于支持Kerberos认证的SSH 1.2.27协议栈中，其Kerberos认证票据存储于用户登录时的当前目录文件中。由于系统可能将用户主目录挂载在NFS网络文件系统上，远程攻击者能够通过网络嗅探目标主机上的该文件，从而获取受害者的Kerberos认证票据。这可能导致攻击者完整窃取、篡改和破坏系统的完整性与可用性，CVSS评分高达7.2，威胁等级严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0575"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01.930","remediation":"建议升级至 OpenSSH 2.0 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞），或升级至 SSH 1.2.28 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，请将 Kerberos 凭据缓存目录配置为本地非 NFS 目录（如通过 KRB5CCNAME 环境变量指定本地路径），并禁用 SSH 1 协议强制使用 SSH 2 协议；若必须使用 NFS 家目录，请配置 NFS 启用 Kerberos 认证并启用安全选项（sec=krb5p）以加密传输。建议同时禁用 SSH 1 协议的 Kerberos 认证功能，改用 SSH 2 公钥认证。立即检查并修改 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 设置 Protocol 2 和 KerberosAuthentication no。定期轮换 Kerberos 凭据并监控异常票据访问。立即部署补丁并验证 SSH 版本 ≥ 2.0。如无法升级，请配置 Kerberos 缓存目录为本地路径 export KRB5CCNAME=/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid} 并确保目录权限 700。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96256265914116&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1426","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4903","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0575.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0575","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0575.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0575.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_kerberos.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0575.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0575.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dfd01263-5503-453b-857e-28b5ed8c250a.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_kerberos.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0671.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0455","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0455.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0571","title":"West Street Software LocalWEB HTTP Server 1.2.0 缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"West Street LocalWEB HTTP Server 1.2.0 存在处理异常长 HTTP GET 请求的处理漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器对请求长度验证不足，当收到过长的 GET 请求时，无法正确分配足够的内存缓冲区，导致缓冲区溢出或系统资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 Windows/Linux 等操作系统，攻击者可通过构造包含超长请求头的 HTTP 请求实现远程拒绝服务攻击。此外，根据 exploitdb 数据库中的相关 PoC 信息，该漏洞可能还存在完整的缓冲区溢出利用链，允许攻击者在特定条件下执行任意代码。对于未打补丁的系统，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发此漏洞，影响范围广泛且危害严重。该漏洞已在 2023 年 3 月的安全更新中修复，建议用户立即更新到最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0571"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01.340","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 West Street LocalWEB HTTP Server 1.2.0 并迁移至现代 Web 服务器（如 Nginx、Apache、IIS 等）。如必须继续使用，请在前端部署 WAF 或防火墙限制 GET 请求 URL 长度不超过 2048 字符，并在网络层限制单次请求包大小作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快完成服务器软件替换迁移。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1423","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-07-8&msg=NCBBKFKDOLAGKIAPMILPCEIHCFAA.labs%40ussrback.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4896","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20054","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0571","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0571.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wc6x-q3v9-6hjf/GHSA-wc6x-q3v9-6hjf.json","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/2009/www_too_long_url.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0571.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f8589611-817e-4a5f-9c0b-ec144d42689e.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0455.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0455.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0455.toml"}]